# #272: Maiev's Fan of Knives after the swap with Immolate: a front-only burst on frames 4-7 that pushes foes back
# along a low angle with a set knockback that never knocks them down (Tom, 26 Oct),
# and a jump cancel from its frame 4; maiev-fan-spike.pad checks the air spike and stall.
# Warden a against Warden b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero warden
# b dashes in, then a dashes to about 46 short of b.
40 b stick -1 0
43 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
56 a stick 0 0
# a turns away from b: the burst misses b just behind her.
90 a stick -0.5 0
94 a stick 0 0
120 a stick 0 -1
120 a tap X 2
121 a stick 0 0
# a turns back: from the same spot the burst strikes b in front on its frame 4.
160 a stick 0.5 0
164 a stick 0 0
200 a stick 0 -1
200 a tap X 2
201 a stick 0 0
# Fan of Knives in the air, cancelled by a double jump on the first frame it allows (its frame 4 has passed).
420 a tap B 8
432 a stick 0 -1
432 a tap X 2
433 a stick 0 0
436 a tap B 2
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): b behind is untouched; b in front is struck on frame 4,
# pushed back at a low angle and lands on its feet; the jump cancels it in the air.
#! expect a 90 ground action 0 facing -1
#! expect a 120 special 16 form 0 action-frame 1 x -0.389
#! absent b 120-146 damage
#! expect a 160 ground action 0 facing 1
#! expect a 200 special 16 form 0 action-frame 1 x 2.880
#! absent b 200-202 damage
#! expect b 203 damage 6.106 hitlag 5 hitstun 24
#! expect b 203 launch up 1 from-air 0 x 10.432 z 2.795
#! absent b 203-260 recovery down 1
#! expect a 432 special 16 form 1 action-frame 1 x 2.880 z 158.700
#! expect a 436 special 0 form 1 action-frame 0 x 2.880 z 179.676
#! expect a 436 applied jump 2 double 1
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
